    "L007: \"SkuPriceLastUpdated MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L009: \"SkuPriceLastUpdated MUST be of type Date/Time.\"",
    "  L010: \"SkuPriceLastUpdated MUST conform to [DateTimeFormat](#attributes.date/timeformat) requirements.\"",
